  "notes": "A sale whose transaction is also recorded on the other term's covered-st, covered-w-st family is recorded twice. A sale flagged ordinary_indicated, box_1f_market_discount, qof_indicated, collectibles_or_special_rate yes is outside the eligible-sale predicate. A sale flagged taxpayer_side_adjustment yes needs an adjustment this return does not compute."
